+     * near Smin (must flush to +0) or near FLT_MAX / Smax (must saturate into the extended
+     * range, which the host cannot represent), and addends that cancel the product exactly
+     * or to within a few ulps. Checked with the native path and with SPU_FP_NATIVE=0's
+     * double-based path. */
